WEBVTT

00:04:28.389 --> 00:04:31.892
In the first week of the worldwide
lockdown in March 2020,

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:36.314
I decided to teach this online
follow-along dance class called SWEATFEST.

00:04:37.023 --> 00:04:38.190
I was hoping --

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.902
(Cheers and applause)

00:04:41.944 --> 00:04:44.655
I was hoping that a couple
of friends would join in,

00:04:44.697 --> 00:04:46.991
but over the course
of the next couple of weeks,

00:04:46.991 --> 00:04:50.661
tens of thousands of people
from all over the world

00:04:50.703 --> 00:04:51.871
joined SWEATFEST ...

00:04:52.663 --> 00:04:54.874
turning our collective isolation

00:04:54.874 --> 00:04:56.709
into a worldwide community.

00:04:58.002 --> 00:04:59.879
It was absolutely beautiful.